vEDfQdtgD1sQ7kNvwGJHd0J&_nc_oc=AdqE0S9jBl8LyneLUborbjzv8UjmHUiz-idzwBaAPc6ZCf-98Cm0o1WDsbFuPw6zUCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBmNKgKRaumObkln4kR2uzWJYGDlpNSvauiSZMH4NjWQ&oe=6AF8A4F7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vyFpUWsW2nMQ7kNvwEVdjkZ&_nc_oc=Adp6SrlkH_-OvySWMl8ivxsGK5zdfQXx1aldIzImrIs3S90LUGFkfuQvNEjzzoTQnHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTiTLdHW3xIn64o1BtUBpdRRonrJ4u_YZ8iHicM8_easQ&oe=6AF8A68A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eCbuRBtmsx8Q7kNvwFNLv4e&_nc_oc=AdqE34_6b_U79ZX_lY4ONYnLvgVNNC1qUyvyAs-w30usFVmV91dTHFpStWgvcZqgptE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRlgQL_EdizKNZKyxT_wieCKlmn99DYaxMDandcuWp5SA&oe=6AF893AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BM3EWeskAt4Q7kNvwEc2iw1&_nc_oc=AdoROd6gj5XTDjB9BGWf4leje3rM5kmvyCI5w2ddD16SaCc_YFDCOItDgddmfemSZ-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTPFU5uUIiCwcqEtEsUxTGVV539EmiRKYWtNNHw2nuhRQ&oe=6AF87D03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SbpBTxYLhKYQ7kNvwEhEWOJ&_nc_oc=AdqUF1aA9Zyf0CAl2ibxWmYoOUh1a6u_bOzFPjQkk5wiWbyIidMYWjUlZ2WLpcmZnL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTGDL5KDwGAv2esLDRLL41nuz7POcADUTO4AO2LXUTQA&oe=6AF87558"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJnlYuyWxTUQ7kNvwGaUbGH&_nc_oc=AdpNFQ3VBkgwv5u9MpqDaP_IPvzrVRkh49AvVALjqq9A9NDoY5xBj-lDzOH5dyzD5Qo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdNlspL0N5TyVVYe-dVVYKt_Gax3GjQQ3gWNfYiQ_6hA&oe=6AF8887C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080